WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:05.320
The two of us are decidedly incompatible.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:12.410
Because we are the light and the shadow born from Princess Ann!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.000
{OP}

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.660
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.540
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.590
Every day it sparkles

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:30.250
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:37.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.820
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:48.460
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:59.610
If your friends are in trouble

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:08.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:10.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.550
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.390
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.190
What's more than just cute

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:22.060
is our promise between girls

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:28.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:34.010
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:46.020
Ace and Regina!

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:46.020
Ace and Regina!

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.230
Cure Ace and Regina are light and shadow?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:54.870
And they were born from the princess?

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:56.200
How could this be?

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.640
Sorry, you won't win by making me die of laughter.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.250
You know,

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.990
every look I get of you makes my stomach turn!

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:12.690
Because you look upon yourself.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.280
Myself?

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.870
If you have the courage to learn the truth,

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.850
I shall reveal to you our destiny!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.790
The Eternal Golden Crown...

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.070
Well?

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.320
Y-You just want me to see it?

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.540
Then hand it over!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.230
Regina!

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:38.110
What happened?

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:44.080
She is witnessing the memories of the kingdom recorded within the Golden Crown.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.480
Memories of the kingdom?

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:47.780
And within that lies...

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.090
the truth behind you two!

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:51.600
Cure Ace!

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.710
Show us too!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.460
I ask as well.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.090
Very well.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:02.600
Close your eyes and connect your hearts with mine.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.250
We shall begin.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.080
We're in...

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.790
Trump Kingdom when it was at peace.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.790
Hey, he's...

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.610
Trump Kingdom's king!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.600
Then that means...

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.280
the baby he's holding is...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.210
Princess Ann.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.540
Princess...

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.530
On the very day Princess Ann came into this world,

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.150
her mother left it.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.150
Doctor...

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.940
Marie Ange, my daughter,

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.600
live in your mother's stead.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:19.610
You are as radiant as the very sun that bestows upon us hopes and dreams.

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:40.040
Ann, wrapped in the King's deep love, was quick to mature.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.330
Ann, your skills have improved yet again.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.670
I've still much to learn, Father!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:58.720
But you'll need to put that effort into more ladylike pursuits soon enough, no?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.490
But Father,

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.680
a proper lady never neglects her swordsmanship!

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.720
She lived her days in happiness.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:18.180
However...

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:22.570
Princess Ann suddenly collapsed due to a mysterious illness.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.510
There must be something that can be done!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.120
This is all modern medicine can do...

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:44.240
Am I to simply watch as the flame of Ann's life extinguishes?!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.600
Dear God,

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:51.370
did claiming my wife not satisfy you?!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.040
Must you steal my daughter as well?!

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.510
I shall not allow it!

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:01.900
There is... one way.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:02.680
What?

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:06.050
The Eternal Golden Crown.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.990
The circlet of gold imbued with boundless wisdom!

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.960
If we had its power...

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.870
I understand.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:16.790
However...

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:23.940
That circlet of gold seals away the darkness that the legendary Precure warriors defeated.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.850
Should we use it,

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:28.600
that darkness may be unleashed!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.450
It pains me to say this, my king,

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.410
but if nothing is done, the princess...

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.370
If I use this,

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.170
Ann will be saved...

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.350
But still...

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:13.100
if that darkness were to be unleashed once more, what would become of the people?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.490
Every peaceful citizen of Trump Kingdom...

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.090
But... But I must!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.570
There is no other way!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.620
<i>Raise her...</i>

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:38.550
<i>into a woman as radiant as the very sun that bestows upon us hopes and dreams...</i>

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.570
A deal with a devil to save her life would bring Ann no joy!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.510
But if nothing is done...

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.760
What must I do?

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.380
I... I...

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.770
I see.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:09.740
Ann's death would mean no less than the end of the world as I know it.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.530
If I can at least save Ann,

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.180
then it matters not what becomes of everything else!

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.390
Don't cry, Makopi.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:08.550
Anyone would struggle to choose between their family and the world.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.260
Mana's right.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:14.500
It's a question with no easy answer.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:21.120
With the wisdom gained from the Golden Crown, Ann was cured.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:25.640
But the true tragedy had yet to begin...

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.050
Oh, Ann! You've awoken!

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.070
Father...

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.860
I heard...

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.930
the dark heartbeat.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:42.330
That selfish, wicked desire...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.530
Who goes there?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:49.970
You committed taboo to save your beloved daughter,

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:53.110
leading the world to destruction!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.810
Truly the ultimate in selfishness!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:02.460
You shall make for a fitting vessel!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.540
Father!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.070
My king!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.270
Father!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.140
My goodness!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.490
No way!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.760
The king...

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.940
Yes.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:47.060
The king's soul was overtaken with Egogy...

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.230
transforming him into King Selfish.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:15.720
You've awakened at last, King Selfish.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.300
Finally our time to shine.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.940
Now, what are your orders?

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.940
Paint this world black with Egogy!

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:35.240
Every Precure defending the kingdom was defeated by the Selfish Army's ferocious attack save for Cure Sword.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.190
Why, Father?

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.900
This country is brimming with love!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.390
Why would you destroy it?

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.320
This world needs no love.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:52.460
The cancer known as love brings only pain!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.300
That is not true!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:58.760
It was your love that saved my life, Father!

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:05.710
My name... is King Selfish!

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:13.150
I shall destroy everything in the world!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.910
Father...

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:25.160
Please, Miracle Dragon Glaive...

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:40.940
The battle ended with Princess Ann turning King Selfish to stone and fleeing into the mirror.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.210
But...

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:44.140
Escape, Cure Sword!

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.080
Alone, if you must!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.150
Princess!

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:51.760
Princess!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.990
That's enough hide-and-seek,

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.430
Princess.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.030
A question, though.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.730
Why did you leave King Selfish alive?

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:09.820
With the power of one of the Three Sacred Treasures, the Miracle Dragon Glaive,

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:13.170
you could have blown him to smithereens.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.450
So, why didn't you?

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:22.890
I see. You let him live 'cause he's your dear old dad.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.130
Well, aren't you selfish!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.560
The royal family's supposed to protect its citizens,

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:34.200
yet you threw them under the bus to save your flesh and blood.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.330
Thicker than water, as they say...

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:41.470
You're the most sickeningly, stupendously selfish one of all!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.380
No!

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.780
<i>If I do nothing, I'll become a Selfish...</i>

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.850
I'll make it painless.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.190
Wha?!

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:05.360
What?!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.570
The love my father gave me...

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:14.070
The love to protect the smiles of my people...

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.280
Selfishness and love are two sides of the same coin.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:23.570
I cannot say which is more important...

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.750
I entrust that answer and the fate of the world...

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:33.180
to the battle between those who will be born from these two psyches.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:39.420
And so I leave you to bear a cruel fate.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.540
Forgive my cowardice...

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.170
Fool!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:52.110
Princess!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.620
Those were...

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.350
The two halves of the princess's psyche!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:04.210
One made its way to King Selfish to become Regina.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:10.380
The other gave birth to me, Madoka Aguri.

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:17.830
And without her psyche, the princess's body became an egg and entered the human world.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.640
And that egg was...

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.630
Ai?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:34.700
So, you girls saw the truth behind Ann and the kingdom.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.450
I can't believe it...

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:41.320
Regina and Aguri used to be the same person!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:46.570
To think that Princess Ann met such an unfortunate fate...

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:50.300
But everything makes sense now.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:54.570
It explains why Regina wanted the Royal Crystals... {I don't want to write "royal Royal Crystal"}

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:58.140
And why Regina doesn't have any memories of her dad.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.770
And most importantly...

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:06.010
her use of the Golden Crown proves she's of Princess Ann's flesh and blood.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:10.070
Does this mean we can't bring the princess back?

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:10.880
Wait!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:15.880
If we can merge her light and her shadow, we could bring the princess back!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:21.330
There's no way for the princess to return to her previous form...

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:25.270
It's a decision she came to through the strength of her heart.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.130
Thank you, Aguri.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.690
You told us the truth,

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:39.510
so now we finally understand how you feel and why you wanted to end this.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:41.050
Mana...

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:46.890
But knowing the truth means even more that violence isn't the answer!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:50.690
There has to be a way to resolve this!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.690
We can all find it together!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.670
Regina, you can help us, too!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.610
Regina?

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:05.350
Mana, I'm happy...

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:11.080
My daddy tried to save me even if the entire world paid the price...

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.950
Regina's eyes changed!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.390
Regina!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:23.930
Have any of you ever been loved so much?

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:29.590
Have you been loved more than the world or the universe itself?

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.990
Only I have...

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:36.530
I can't turn my back on Daddy after that!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:41.670
I'll fight for Daddy until the bitter end!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.270
You can't, Regina!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.520
Daddy?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.530
He's finally awakened!

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.670
I'm coming, Daddy!

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:18.220
Regina!

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:27.820
It seems we've no choice left but to defeat Regina and King Selfish.

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.290
Aguri...

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:34.320
I bear the cross of the royal family.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:38.060
And as long as Regina and King Selfish yet live,

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:41.440
Trump Kingdom will never recover.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.740
You're sure you won't regret it?

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:50.700
I understand your desire to fulfill the princess's goal all too well.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.080
But...

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.710
won't <i>you</i> be hurt in the end?

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:56.870
Makoto...

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:58.620
Look out!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.240
Stop it, Regina!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.800
I won't, Mana!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:18.280
My kingdom needs only Regina and me!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.840
Begone!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:30.880
Now, let's eliminate humanity and create a world for just the two of us.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:31.670
Okay!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:36.350
I'll make all your wishes come true, Daddy!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.970
Girls, are you all right?

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:42.930
Yeah...

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:43.800
Somehow!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.370
King Selfish...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.310
Entered the human world!

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:58.430
For now, we have to stop those two.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:01.500
I don't have all the answers now,

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:06.390
so all we can do is hit 'em with all the love we've got!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.540
That's Mana's kind of plan.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:11.290
Though I don't think it's a bad one.

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.590
Aguri.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.630
Understood.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.240
Let us go!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:28.840
What's that?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.890
We'll protect this world!

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.590
Girls, let's go!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.360
Charles!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.300
Precure Love Link!

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.070
L-O-V-E!

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:52.710
L-O-V-E!

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:53.450
L-O-V-E!

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:54.550
L-O-V-E!

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:58.500
Precure Dress Up!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.490
Kyupirappa!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:21.640
Brimming with love,

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:23.870
Cure Heart!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.000
The light of wisdom,

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.340
Cure Diamond!

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:34.370
The warmth of the sun,

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.730
Cure Rosetta!

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.440
The blade of courage,

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.590
Cure Sword!

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.320
Love's trump card,

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.810
Cure Ace!

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:52.320
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:54.600
Dokidoki Precure!

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:58.530
Regina, King Selfish,

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.840
I, Cure Heart,

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:04.010
will make your heart race once more!

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:28.390
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:31.660
Cure Heart's Determination!

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:31.660
Cure Heart's Determination!

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:33.660
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
